01:17:38,823 --> 01:17:44,823
Escobar: Paradise Lost (also known as Paradise Lost) is a 2014 romantic thriller film
written and directed by Andrea Di Stefano in his directorial debut.

12
01:24:42,352 --> 01:24:48,352
The film chronicles the life of a surfer who falls in love while working with his brother in
Colombia and finds out that the girl's uncle is Colombian drug lord Pablo Escobar.

13
01:31:45,882 --> 01:31:51,882
RADiUS-TWC acquired the North American distribution
rights of the film in February 2014.

14
01:38:49,411 --> 01:38:55,411
The film premiered at the 2014 Toronto International Film Festival on September 11,
2014 and had a limited release  in the United States on June 26, 2015.

15
